---
const pillars = [
  {
    title: 'Listen',
    body: 'What you\'re trying to fix, what "better" looks like, and where the operation actually hurts — before we talk tools.',
  },
  {
    title: 'Data readiness',
    body: 'Whether your current systems can support integrated reporting or AI — what connects today, what doesn\'t, and what would need to.',
  },
  {
    title: 'Team AI skills',
    body: 'Where your people are strong, where they\'re stuck, and whether staff training would help before any build will stick.',
  },
];
---

<section class="entry-doors section">
  <p class="section-label">How we start</p>
  <h2 class="section-title">One entry door: Discovery</h2>
  <p class="section-desc">
    Discovery is a Data Readiness Audit. Every client starts here. We listen to what you need, check whether your systems are ready for integrated reporting or AI, and evaluate your team's AI skills at the same time. What comes next is decided by what we find — not by a menu of projects.
  </p>

  <div class="pillar-grid">
    {pillars.map(pillar => (
      <div class="pillar-card">
        <h3 class="pillar-title">{pillar.title}</h3>
        <p class="pillar-body">{pillar.body}</p>
      </div>
    ))}
  </div>

  <div class="discovery-cta">
    <a href="/services" class="btn btn-outline">See how Discovery works</a>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .pillar-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  .pillar-card {
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid #E8E0D6;
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 32px 28px;
  }

  .pillar-title {
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    color: var(--charcoal);
    line-height: 1.25;
  }

  .pillar-body {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--charcoal);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .discovery-cta {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 36px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .pillar-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
